  "_note": "Hand-authored cross-platform vectors for packages/shared/src/algorithms/taskEvents.ts's resolveTaskWindowState (Windowed Completion PR A, docs/WINDOWED_COMPLETION.md §Semantics per task type). packages/shared/tests/algorithms/taskEvents.test.ts runs these through the shared TS function; apps/ios/OYBCTests/TaskEventVectorTests.swift runs the SAME vectors through the Swift mirror. Minimal shapes: task={type,maxCount(nullable)}; event={kind,delta(nullable),occurredAt,isDeleted}; windowStart is nullable (null = lifetime). expected={isCompleted,count}. Covers normal/counting x in-window / pre-window / tombstoned / negative-sum clamp / overshoot-preserved / boundary-inclusive / lifetime.",
