  "_linkedCounterDisplayNote": "resolveLinkedCounterDisplay (taskEvents.ts) <-> Swift resolveLinkedCounterDisplay (Helpers/TaskEvents.swift): what a LINKED counting square/row shows. Window-stamped rows (sharedCounterId + startDate + createdInWizard, COUNTING) with an event map = the ROOT's in-window increment sum ([startDate, endDate] inclusive, optional sealedAt bound) for BOTH count and completion; hub-linked rows or no event map = currentCount - baseline (low-clamped) + the latch. eventsByTaskId null = no map. Consumed by packages/shared/tests/algorithms/taskEvents.test.ts and apps/ios/OYBCTests/TaskEventVectorTests.swift.",
